#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-outputs/83c809cb-299c-4071-a662-d10ba7e24996-1.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Wynik poprzedniej komórki kodu](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/utility-ii/extracted-outputs/83c809cb-299c-4071-a662-d10ba7e24996-1.avif)\n"

